  "code" : "public int upperBound(int[] arr, int n, int x) {\n    int low = 0, high = n - 1, ans = n;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (arr[mid] > x) {\n            ans = mid;\n            high = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
